==============================================================================================================================
0.  THE DERIVATION AND ITS VALIDATION -- before any datum is touched
==============================================================================================================================
  [PASS] V0a every prescription must reduce EXACTLY to nu(y) g_N when the external field is switched off, or the differences below would be differences of bookkeeping and not of physics   (max |ratio-1| over the five prescriptions = 0.00e+00)
     y_ext   L(y_e)  flux/nu_e    1+L/3  eq60/nu_e      1+L  perp/nu_e  flux/eq60
